{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01329",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 5.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.89,
      "end_seconds": 11.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.64,
      "end_seconds": 18.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a sore tongue, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.09,
      "end_seconds": 27.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.66,
      "end_seconds": 30.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Probably about three months. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.91,
      "end_seconds": 35.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.57,
      "end_seconds": 38.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "It's, It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.36,
      "end_seconds": 46.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.52,
      "end_seconds": 54.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get being unsteady on my feet as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.76,
      "end_seconds": 58.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Have you been feeling very tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.79,
      "end_seconds": 68.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, that too. As for feeling very tired, mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.95,
      "end_seconds": 75.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any loss of vision or weakness of one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.53,
      "end_seconds": 81.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Ah, no, no loss of vision or weakness of one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.45,
      "end_seconds": 87.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Any bladder problems, rash or diarrhoea at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.97,
      "end_seconds": 97.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "I haven't had bladder problems, rash or diarrhoea, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.94,
      "end_seconds": 101.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.89,
      "end_seconds": 103.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.95,
      "end_seconds": 109.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.08,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 18.58,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I only drink at family occasions. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.35,
      "end_seconds": 134.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.28,
      "end_seconds": 141.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for about ten years. Diabetes, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.75,
      "end_seconds": 148.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux and diabetes are known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.0,
      "end_seconds": 168.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.63,
      "end_seconds": 178.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "So, just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.68,
      "end_seconds": 191.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.64,
      "end_seconds": 197.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Metformin. I take it 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.48,
      "end_seconds": 204.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.42,
      "end_seconds": 210.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.14,
      "end_seconds": 215.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.69,
      "end_seconds": 220.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.89,
      "end_seconds": 226.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "So, shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.15,
      "end_seconds": 240.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.96,
      "end_seconds": 266.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 111 over 77, heart rate 65, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.7,
      "end_seconds": 269.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.42,
      "end_seconds": 274.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.89,
      "end_seconds": 282.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Right, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.1,
      "end_seconds": 284.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.69,
      "end_seconds": 295.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Your vibration sense is reduced at the ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.27,
      "end_seconds": 298.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.03,
      "end_seconds": 314.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "The tongue looks smooth and red."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.29,
      "end_seconds": 315.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.25,
      "end_seconds": 336.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.9,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, I don't have a clear answer today: symptoms that fit a vitamin B12 deficiency is possible, and so is diabetic nerve damage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.23,
      "end_seconds": 361.72,
      "duration_seconds": 16.49,
      "text": "Let's book a full blood count to look into tiredness. I'm sending you for a vitamin B12 level because of tingling and tiredness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.97,
      "end_seconds": 365.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.3,
      "end_seconds": 374.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "I'll start you on cyanocobalamin, 1000 micrograms, every other day, for two weeks. It's for low vitamin B12."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.91,
      "end_seconds": 378.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.74,
      "end_seconds": 385.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Eating more eggs, dairy and fortified cereals will help over time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.78,
      "end_seconds": 395.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.54,
      "end_seconds": 399.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.4,
      "end_seconds": 409.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the results are back. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.11,
      "end_seconds": 413.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.79,
      "end_seconds": 417.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}